%% request: a slack bot that answers from our docs
flowchart LR
    Member([💬 Team member @mentions bot]) --> Slack{{Slack Events API}}
    Slack -->|app_mention| Handler[Bolt handler]
    Handler --> Ack[⏱️ Ack within 3s]
    Handler --> Queue[[Job queue]]
    Queue --> Worker[Answer worker]

    subgraph Retrieval["🔎 Retrieval"]
        Worker --> Embed[Embed question]
        Embed --> VecDB[(Vector index)]
        VecDB --> TopK[Top 8 chunks]
        Worker --> KW[(Keyword search)]
        KW --> TopK
        TopK --> Rerank{{Reranker}}
    end

    subgraph Gen["🧠 Generation"]
        Rerank --> Prompt[/Prompt with sources/]
        Prompt --> LLM[LLM]
        LLM --> Check{Answer grounded?}
        Check -- no --> Refuse[🤷 'Not in our docs' + link to search]
        Check -- yes --> Cite[Add source links]
    end

    Cite --> Reply[Post threaded reply]
    Refuse --> Reply
    Reply --> Slack

    Worker -- no sources --> Refuse
    Reply --> Feedback{{👍 / 👎 reactions}}
    Feedback -->|down| Log[(Feedback log)]
    Log --> Review[Weekly doc gap review]

    subgraph Sync["🔄 Doc sync"]
        Conf[(Confluence)] --> Ingest[Nightly ingest]
        Git[(Git docs repo)] --> Ingest
        Ingest --> VecDB
    end

    style Refuse fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#856404
    style Reply fill:#d1e7dd,stroke:#0f5132
